ase as part of one or more event reminders, but not in the $PSReminderTag variable.\r\n\r\n## PARAMETERS\r\n\r\n### CommonParameters\r\n\r\nThis cmdlet supports the common parameters: -Debug, -ErrorAction, -ErrorVariable, -InformationAction, -InformationVariable, -OutVariable, -OutBuffer, -PipelineVariable, -Verbose, -WarningAction, and -WarningVariable. For more information, see [about_CommonParameters","target":"http://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?LinkID=113216","line":35},{"title":"Get-PSReminderPreference","target":"Get-PSReminderPreference.md","line":65},{"title":"Export-PSReminderPreference","target":"Export-PSReminderPreference.md","line":67}],"metadata":{"external help file":"PSReminderLite-help.xml","Module Name":"PSReminderLite","online version":null,"schema":"2.0.0"},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[[16,18],[30,41]],"key":"docs/PSModulesHelp/PSReminderLite/Get-PSReminderTag.md"},
